<div class="intro-card" id="intro-card" role="region" aria-label="What this app does">
    <div class="intro-head">
        <h2 class="intro-title">What is this?</h2>
        <button type="button" class="link" id="intro-dismiss" @onclick="Dismiss">Hide</button>
    </div>
    <p class="intro-lead">It turns the mods you want into one short search string for the game's Highlight box.</p>
    <ul class="intro-goals">
        <li><b>Exact matches</b> — only the gear you want, not everything with the same words.</li>
        <li><b>More mods</b> — the shortest string, so more mods fit within the 250-character limit.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="intro-flow">Pick mods → copy → paste. <b>Per slot</b> gives each gear slot its own list; matching items light up.</p>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnDismiss { get; set; }

    private Task Dismiss() => OnDismiss.InvokeAsync();
}
